       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-CMD-ACTION LS-PARAM1 LS-PARAM2
           LS-PARAM3 LS-PARAM4 LS-PARAM5 LS-PARAM6 LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER.

       MAIN-LOGIC.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-RESULT
           MOVE LS-PARAM1 TO WS-P1
           MOVE LS-PARAM2 TO WS-P2
           MOVE LS-PARAM3 TO WS-P3
           MOVE LS-PARAM4 TO WS-P4
           MOVE LS-PARAM5 TO WS-P5
           MOVE LS-PARAM6 TO WS-P6
           PERFORM TRIM-ALL
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:10) = "TRL_CREATE"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_CREATE
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:8) = "TRL_LIST"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_LIST
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:7) = "TRL_GET"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_GET
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:8) = "TRL_CALC"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_CALC
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:10) = "TRL_UPDATE"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_UPDATE
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:10) = "TRL_DELETE"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_DELETE
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:11) = "TRL_SUMMARY"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_SUMMARY
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:12) = "TRL_VALIDATE"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_VALIDATE
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:10) = "TRL_EXPORT"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_EXPORT
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:9) = "TRL_AUDIT"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_AUDIT
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:10) = "TRL_STATUS"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_STATUS
               WHEN LS-CMD-ACTION(1:9) = "TRL_CLOSE"
                   PERFORM ACTION-TRL_CLOSE
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE "ERROR|INVALID_ACTION" TO WS-RESULT
           END-EVALUATE
           MOVE WS-RESULT TO LS-OUTPUT-BUFFER
           GOBACK.

